WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:04.185
Surprised, Toad looked at Rat.

2
00:00:04.186 --> 00:00:07.391
"What do you mean?" asked Toad.

3
00:00:07.392 --> 00:00:09.593
"What haven’t I heard?"

4
00:00:09.594 --> 00:00:13.237
"I thought you knew," said Rat.

5
00:00:13.238 --> 00:00:17.524
"Go on, Ratty," said Toad. "Tell me!"

6
00:00:17.525 --> 00:00:21.667
"It’s the weasels and ferrets," said Rat.

7
00:00:21.668 --> 00:00:27.036
"The Wild-Wooders?" cried Toad, turning pale.

8
00:00:27.037 --> 00:00:30.012
"What have they done?"

9
00:00:30.013 --> 00:00:33.337
"I don’t know how to tell you," said Rat.

10
00:00:33.338 --> 00:00:36.225
Rat stood up from the table.

11
00:00:36.226 --> 00:00:39.931
He walked back and forth.

12
00:00:39.932 --> 00:00:44.987
"Tell me, please!" said Toad.

13
00:00:44.988 --> 00:00:48.789
"They took over Toad Hall!" said Rat.

14
00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:53.886
"My beautiful Toad Hall?" cried Toad.

15
00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:58.279
A big tear formed in each eye.

16
00:00:58.280 --> 00:01:04.723
The tears splashed on the table: plop, plop!

17
00:01:04.724 --> 00:01:07.967
"The police caught you," said Rat.

18
00:01:07.968 --> 00:01:10.725
"Everyone here heard the news.

19
00:01:10.726 --> 00:01:14.235
All the Riverbankers were on your side."

20
00:01:14.236 --> 00:01:17.362
Toad smiled proudly.

21
00:01:17.363 --> 00:01:21.946
"But the weasels called you a thief!" said Rat.

22
00:01:21.947 --> 00:01:25.522
"The ferrets said you would go to jail!

23
00:01:25.523 --> 00:01:29.005
They said you would never come back!"

24
00:01:29.006 --> 00:01:32.685
Toad nodded sadly.

25
00:01:32.686 --> 00:01:37.141
"Mole and Badger moved into Toad Hall," said Rat.

26
00:01:37.142 --> 00:01:40.027
"They knew you would come home.

27
00:01:40.028 --> 00:01:43.064
They watched your house for you."

28
00:01:43.065 --> 00:01:47.363
"What great friends," said Toad.

29
00:01:47.364 --> 00:01:55.241
"But one night," said Rat, "the Wild-Wooders came with guns."

30
00:01:55.242 --> 00:02:00.145
"Those bullies!" cried Toad.

